  "_note": "Ed25519 vectors 1-3 are reproduced verbatim from RFC 8032 §7.1 and are reproducible by any RFC 8032-compliant Ed25519 implementation — no MXD-specific code is needed. The MXD-specific vectors test signing over realistic message sizes and the algorithm-dispatch length-validation rules of MXD-03 §6. Dilithium5 vectors reference MXD-PQ-01-derived keypairs (the experimental HKDF-Expand placeholder of MXD-03 v1.0.0 §5.3 has been withdrawn).",
