    {
      "name": "mxd_64_byte_message_sighash_size",
      "_note": "Tests Ed25519 over a 64-byte message — the size of an MXD-04 sighash. Uses the RFC 8032 TEST 1 keypair so integrators can sanity-check that their lib agrees on RFC inputs and that the signing path works with realistic MXD message sizes. msg_hex is bytes 0x00..0x3f (deterministic fill).",
